<main class="w-full h-full col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 p-4 pl-20 overflow-auto">
  <div class="page-content">
    <div class="container-fluid px-[0.625rem]">
      <div class="md:flex items-center justify-between pb-6">
        <h4 class="text-[18px] font-medium text-gray-800 mb-sm-0 grow dark:text-gray-100 mb-2 md:mb-0">
          星系通知订阅
        </h4>
      </div>

      <div
        :if={not @notifications_enabled? or not @smtp_configured?}
        class="alert alert-warning mb-6 text-sm"
      >
        <span>
          通知功能当前未启用。请在服务端设置 <code>WANDERER_NOTIFICATIONS_ENABLED=true</code>
          以及 <code>SMTP_HOST</code>/<code>SMTP_PORT</code>/<code>SMTP_USER</code>/<code>SMTP_PASS</code> 后重启服务。订阅配置仍然可以保存，但不会发送邮件。
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 2xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:border-zinc-600 2xl:col-span-2">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">
              {if @editing_id, do: "编辑订阅", else: "新建订阅"}
            </h5>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
              订阅必须选择一张地图，系统只会评估该地图中已开启位置跟踪、且仍然拥有该地图权限的角色。
              可以选择只监控指定的几个星系，也可以不指定星系、按虫洞等级与 Top1 军团活跃情况筛选。
            </p>

            <div :if={@errors != []} class="alert alert-error mb-3 text-sm">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                <li :for={error <- @errors}>{error}</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <.form
              for={@form}
              id="notification-form"
              phx-change="validate"
              phx-submit="save"
              class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"
            >
              <div class="md:col-span-2">
                <.input
                  field={@form[:map_id]}
                  type="select"
                  label="地图"
                  prompt="请选择地图"
                  required
                  options={Enum.map(@maps, &{map_option_label(&1, @tracked_counts), &1.id})}
                />
                <p :if={@maps == []} class="text-xs text-warning mt-1">
                  你没有可管理的地图，无法创建订阅。
                </p>
              </div>

              <.input field={@form[:name]} type="text" label="订阅名称" required />

              <.input
                field={@form[:cooldown_hours]}
                type="number"
                label="冷却时间（小时）"
                min="1"
                max="720"
                required
              />

              <div class="md:col-span-2">
                <span class="label-text">筛选方式</span>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mt-2">
                  <label class="flex items-start gap-2 flex-1 cursor-pointer rounded border border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-600 p-3">
                    <input
                      type="radio"
                      class="radio radio-sm mt-0.5"
                      name="subscription[mode]"
                      value="systems"
                      checked={@form[:mode].value == "systems"}
                    />
                    <span>
                      <span class="block text-sm text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">指定星系</span>
                      <span class="block text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                        只监控清单中的星系，不需要再填写等级、活跃天数或时区
                      </span>
                    </span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="flex items-start gap-2 flex-1 cursor-pointer rounded border border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-600 p-3">
                    <input
                      type="radio"
                      class="radio radio-sm mt-0.5"
                      name="subscription[mode]"
                      value="filters"
                      checked={@form[:mode].value == "filters"}
                    />
                    <span>
                      <span class="block text-sm text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">按条件筛选</span>
                      <span class="block text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                        不指定星系，对角色进入的星系按等级、活跃天数和时区匹配
                      </span>
                    </span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div :if={@form[:mode].value == "systems"} class="md:col-span-2">
                <.input
                  field={@form[:systems]}
                  type="textarea"
                  label="星系（每行一个，也支持逗号分隔；英文名、中文名或星系 ID）"
                  placeholder={"例如：\nJ123456\nC140\nJita\n" <> "吉塔"}
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div
                :if={@form[:mode].value == "filters"}
                class="md:col-span-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"
              >
                <div class="md:col-span-2">
                  <span class="label-text">虫洞星系等级（不选表示不限）</span>
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 mt-2">
                    <label
                      :for={class <- @classes}
                      class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                    >
                      <input
                        type="checkbox"
                        class="checkbox checkbox-sm"
                        name="subscription[wormhole_classes][]"
                        value={class}
                        checked={
                          to_string(class) in checkbox_values(@form[:wormhole_classes].value)
                        }
                      />
                      <span>C{class}</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <.input
                  field={@form[:min_active_days]}
                  type="number"
                  label="Top1 活跃军团 60D 活跃天数下限"
                  min="0"
                  max="60"
                  placeholder="不限"
                />

                <.input
                  field={@form[:max_active_days]}
                  type="number"
                  label="Top1 活跃军团 60D 活跃天数上限"
                  min="0"
                  max="60"
                  placeholder="不限"
                />

                <.input
                  field={@form[:timezone_min]}
                  type="select"
                  label="Top1 活跃军团时区下限"
                  prompt="不限"
                  options={
                    Enum.map(@timezone_options, &{timezone_label(&1), Integer.to_string(&1)})
                  }
                />

                <.input
                  field={@form[:timezone_max]}
                  type="select"
                  label="Top1 活跃军团时区上限"
                  prompt="不限"
                  options={
                    Enum.map(@timezone_options, &{timezone_label(&1), Integer.to_string(&1)})
                  }
                />

                <div class="md:col-span-2">
                  <.input
                    type="checkbox"
                    field={@form[:allow_missing_timezone]}
                    label="Top1 军团没有推断时区时仍然匹配"
                  />
                </div>

                <p class="md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                  至少设置虫洞等级、活跃天数或时区中的一个。虫洞等级 1-6
                  只适用于虫洞星系；Top1 军团的活跃天数与时区来自 J-Space Helper
                  的虫洞击杀统计，已知空间通常没有这些数据。
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="md:col-span-2">
                <.input type="checkbox" field={@form[:enabled]} label="启用此订阅" />
              </div>

              <div class="md:col-span-2">
                <.input
                  field={@form[:recipient_emails]}
                  type="textarea"
                  label="收件邮箱（每行一个，也支持逗号分隔）"
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div class="md:col-span-2 flex items-center gap-3 mt-2">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                  {if @editing_id, do: "保存修改", else: "创建订阅"}
                </button>
                <button
                  :if={@editing_id}
                  type="button"
                  phx-click="cancel"
                  class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
                >
                  取消
                </button>
              </div>
            </.form>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:border-zinc-600">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">最近发送记录</h5>
            <p :if={@deliveries == []} class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">
              暂无发送记录。
            </p>
            <div :if={@deliveries != []} class="overflow-x-auto mt-2">
              <table class="table table-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>时间</th>
                    <th>订阅</th>
                    <th>星系</th>
                    <th>角色</th>
                    <th>状态</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr :for={delivery <- @deliveries}>
                    <td class="whitespace-nowrap text-xs">{format_time(delivery.inserted_at)}</td>
                    <td class="text-xs">
                      {Map.get(@subscription_names, delivery.subscription_id, "-")}
                    </td>
                    <td class="text-xs">{delivery.system_name || delivery.system_id}</td>
                    <td class="text-xs">{delivery.character_name || "-"}</td>
                    <td class="text-xs">
                      <span class={["badge badge-sm", status_class(delivery.status)]}>
                        {delivery.status}
                      </span>
                      <span :if={delivery.error} class="text-error ml-1" title={delivery.error}>
                        !
                      </span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <h5 class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">我的订阅</h5>
        <p :if={@subscriptions == []} class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          还没有订阅。在上方选择地图并填写筛选条件后创建。
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
          <div
            :for={subscription <- @subscriptions}
            class="card dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:border-zinc-600"
          >
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2">
                <div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <h5 class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">{subscription.name}</h5>
                    <span class={[
                      "badge badge-sm",
                      if(subscription.enabled, do: "badge-success", else: "badge-ghost")
                    ]}>
                      {if subscription.enabled, do: "启用", else: "停用"}
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">
                    地图：{map_name(@maps, subscription.map_id) || subscription.map_id}
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs"
                    phx-click="edit"
                    phx-value-id={subscription.id}
                  >
                    编辑
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs"
                    phx-click="test"
                    phx-value-id={subscription.id}
                    disabled={not @notifications_enabled? or not @smtp_configured?}
                  >
                    测试邮件
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs"
                    phx-click="toggle"
                    phx-value-id={subscription.id}
                  >
                    {if subscription.enabled, do: "停用", else: "启用"}
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs text-error"
                    phx-click="delete"
                    phx-value-id={subscription.id}
                    data-confirm="确定删除该订阅？发送记录也会一起删除。"
                  >
                    删除
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mt-2">
                {if specific_subscription?(subscription),
                  do: "星系：#{Enum.join(subscription.system_names, "、")}",
                  else: "匹配方式：按条件筛选"}
              </p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">
                {filter_summary(subscription)}
              </p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">
                收件人：{Enum.join(subscription.recipient_emails, "、")}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
